<!-- Skills/MCP administration flow. Copy is taken from the current iPad app
     catalog (FloeAgent/FloeApp/Resources/Localizable.xcstrings, keys quoted in
     each line's comment) wherever the original has a string, except:
       - Apple-only credential wording (Keychain) is replaced by honest
         Android wording ("saved securely"), as the provider flow does;
       - strings the original renders as untranslated English literals
         (Owner/Repository/Branch/Commit/Before/After) get aligned zh-rCN
         translations because both Floe languages must stay in sync;
       - a small number of Android-specific presentation strings (badges,
         stage labels, dialog body copy) are new, concise and native in tone.
     No capability, availability or progress string claims more than the host
     projection states. -->
